# Monorepo-wide safety net. Each project's own .gitignore is authoritative
# for that project -- see job-scanner/.gitignore and sports-data-gen/.gitignore,
# both of which document their reasoning inline. Only add a rule here if it
# should hold for EVERY project in this repo, including ones not yet added.

# Python, per-machine
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/

# Secrets. The negation is **-prefixed so it reaches every subdirectory.
.env
.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Scratch
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.tmp

# OS / editor
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.DS_Store
